 soldiers from Danyang and joining the campaign against Dong Zhuo, being appointed as a military adviser. Thereafter, he followed Cao Cao into Yuan Shao's camp and was ordered to contest Yu Province against Sun Jian, suffering defeat twice. He ultimately withdrew to Huiji, where he was killed by Xu Gong, the Governor of Wujun.","jp":"会稽の周氏三兄弟（周昕、周昂、周喁）の末弟。曹操の初期の軍師であり、袁紹配下の豫州刺史。かつて曹操の招きに応じ、丹陽兵二千を募って董卓討伐に従軍し、軍師に任じられた。その後、曹操とともに袁紹陣営に加わり、命を受けて豫州を巡り孫堅と交戦するも、二度にわたり敗北した。最終的に会稽へと退いたが、呉郡太守の許貢に殺害された。","kr":"회계 주씨 삼형제(주흔, 주앙, 주우) 중 막내로, 조조의 초기 군사이자 원소 휘하의 예주자사다. 일찍이 조조의 부름에 응해 단양병 2,000명을 모집하여 동탁 토벌에 종군하였고, 군사로 임명되었다. 이후 조조를 따라 원소 진영에 합류하였으며, 명을 받아 예주를 다투며 손견과 교전하였으나 두 차례 패배하였다. 결국 회계로 물러났으나 오군태수 허공에게 피살되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1026515","remark":"","surname":"周","surnameTc":"周","surnameEn":"Zhou","surnameJp":"周","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"喁","nameTc":"喁","nameEn":"Yong","nameJp":"喁","nameKr":"우","nameOther":"","word":"仁明","wordTc":"仁明","wordEn":"Renming","wordJp":"仁明","wordKr":"인명","wordOther":"","icon":"周喁","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"68","force":"57","wise":"72","politics":"69","charm":"68","will":"65","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"31/31/31/31/32/72/50/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1004602","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002005","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5400","battleSoulPoint":"4000","debateSoulPoint":"6000","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"1000905","professions":"0/0/0/3/1/0/2/0/0/0/3/2/0/2/1/0/2/1/2/2/0/1/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"76","loyalty":"99","